<title>USA: Illinois direct hogs $0.50 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>Illinois direct hogs $0.50 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $0.50 higher. Demand moderate to good. Top $60.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-2  230-260 lbs. 59.00-60.00, few 60.50</p>
<p>US 2-3  230-260 lbs. 58.00-59.00</p>
<p>Sows: Steady to 1.00 higher. Top 52.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-500 lbs. Mostly 44.00-47.00, few 48.00</p>
<p>	  500-600 lbs. 46.00-50.00, few 51.00</p>
<p>few over 600 lbs. 48.00-51.00, few 52.00</p>
</text>
